  "final_answer": "On a Mac, press and hold Shift + Command + 3 to take a screenshot of the entire screen. If a thumbnail appears in the corner, click it to edit the screenshot, or wait for it to save to your desktop.\n\nOther options:\n- Shift + Command + 4: capture a selected portion of the screen.\n- Shift + Command + 4, then Space bar: capture a window or menu.\n- Shift + Command + 5: open the Screenshot toolbar for more capture and recording options.",
